{"seq":7,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:09:46.818Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1f2466e8bc49b11cdd68dff09a6ba3d1a13e81cf95213ac5f42ad85291bce395","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, here are the three answers. Only the takeover is inferred, because no note states it outright.\n\n1. **Takeover:** Bettina Kroll took over Saltmarsh Provisions from you, effective Monday, October 6, 2025. Moss's Sunday prep note says the account \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6\". Later notes and the channel call it \"Bettina's grocery account\" or \"Sofia's old grocery account\". I'm inferring Bettina from those.\n\n2. **Discount:** 10%. On Nov 17, 2025, Bettina first posted 12% in #coastal-team. A few minutes later she retracted it and corrected it to 10%, saying she had misread June's draft worksheet.\n\n3. **Corinne's admin access ticket:** PD-4827. Kwame opened it on Oct 15, 2025, when Corinne lost her admin rights. PD-4824 is a different ticket. It covers the reefer loads moved from door 3 to door 4 that showed up in the exception report."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
